copying, or redistributing the software by any means, or by purchasing or using
a Commercial Edition package, you accept the terms of this Agreement that apply
to the relevant software or service. If you do not agree, stop using the
relevant software or service.

Duosuan Technology may adopt or amend this Agreement from time to time as
necessary. Any amendment will be announced by publication on the relevant
website, without separate notice. An amended Agreement takes effect
automatically upon publication and becomes part of this Agreement.

2. Definitions

2.1 "Software" means the core code, plugins, source code, object code,
installers, images, modified versions, updates, and upgrades of the Banban AI
Low-Code Platform that are released by Duosuan Technology and expressly marked
as GPLv3.

2.2 "Community Edition" means the free version of the Software that Duosuan
Technology makes available to users through public channels.

2.3 "Commercial Edition" means a software version or authorized service
provided by Duosuan Technology or its authorized channels that includes
commercial plugins, commercial features, technical support, or other
additional benefits.

2.4 "Basic Edition," "Professional Edition," "Enterprise Edition," and
"Group Edition" mean the four packages of the Commercial Edition. Their
features, prices, terms, and support are subject to the applicable order page or
written contract.

2.5 "Application" means an application developed by a user based on the
Software or Commercial Edition features for a specific business scenario, such
as an ERP or CRM system.

2.6 "Third-Party Customer" means an individual, enterprise, or other
organization that purchases, accepts, or uses an Application.

2.7 "Third-Party Open-Source Software" means a component provided with the
Software or Commercial Edition that is subject to its own open-source license
or copyright notice.

